B.aEN=new A.f7("Quantum Key Distribution -BB84 PROTOCOLS","As part of my **Capstone Project** for **QubitXQubits 2024**, I developed a simulation of the **BB84 quantum key distribution** protocol, focusing on secure quantum communication. The project included **Eve's attack** simulations, implementing **Intercept-and-Send** and **Entangle-Qubit Attack** functions to analyze potential security breaches. Additionally, I explored a **quantum entanglement-based** approach to enhance security, demonstrating how entanglement can improve key distribution integrity against **eavesdropping** attempts.","Cirq","Capstone Project","https://github.com/Risav25Pokhrel/BB84-Quantum-Key-Distribution")
